{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6\u25c6What is Dreamland\u25c6\u25c6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreamland is a 2D fighting game for up to 4 players! Control the girls as they bare their bodies and souls in a battle for victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2385050/extras/b733c9d05f62020c335175c302f7b1ec.poster.avif?t=1751965468\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2385050/extras/b733c9d05f62020c335175c302f7b1ec.webm?t=1751965468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2385050/extras/b733c9d05f62020c335175c302f7b1ec.mp4?t=1751965468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2385050/extras/3c112db26b2cbcc7403081da68847822.poster.avif?t=1751965468\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2385050/extras/3c112db26b2cbcc7403081da68847822.webm?t=1751965468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2385050/extras/3c112db26b2cbcc7403081da68847822.mp4?t=1751965468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6\u25c6Game Rules\u25c6\u25c6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreamland is a 2D fighting game for up to 4 players. Select a character and stage to start the game After selecting a character and stage, the game starts with 3 units remaining! Use combos and special moves to blast your enemies out of the field and reduce your opponent's remaining units!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class